cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use da-cli, please cite it as below."
title: "da-cli: a stdlib-only DeviantArt CLI for sync, search, and browse"
abstract: >-
  A Python 3 command-line tool (no runtime dependencies) that authenticates
  against DeviantArt with OAuth 2.1 + PKCE, syncs watched-artist galleries
  to a local destination directory, and exposes search / browse / metadata
  helpers.
authors:
  - name: "FZ2000"
    alias: FZ2000
type: software
license: MIT
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-07-30"
repository-code: "https://github.com/FZ2000/da-cli"
url: "https://github.com/FZ2000/da-cli"
keywords:
  - deviantart
  - cli
  - oauth
  - sync
  - gallery
  - python
  - stdlib
